{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40694","headline":"送韦太尉自坤维除广陵 · 李洞","name":"送韦太尉自坤维除广陵","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"全蜀拜扬州，征东辍武侯。\n直来万里月，旁到五峰秋。\n幢冷遮高雪，旗闲卓乱流。\n谢朝明主喜，登省旧寮愁。\n隔海城通舶，连河市响楼。\n千官倚元老，虚梦法云游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李洞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40694.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40694","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}